{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay hoards of enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deep dungeons and slay hoards of enemies in your quests to settle your ancient grudges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore 3 different types of dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 different dungeons types. Each run has its own randomly generated dungeon tree and you get to choose which direction to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free your fellow dwarfs from capture and they will join you on your quests! Each character has their own unique ultimate ability and more powerful starting weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade each Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade each character through a skill tree and unlock many powerful passives to help you on your runs!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913850?t=1758563048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913850/5c5e0a31dc0461c734f87b011e98b2604c196c7c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758563048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913850/8ad2ee69f9889e3dd1c40aecd7cfab700ad3f32c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758563048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913850/8ad2ee69f9889e3dd1c40aecd7cfab700ad3f32c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758563048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay hoards of enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deep dungeons and slay hoards of enemies in your quests to settle your ancient grudges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore 3 different types of dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_parag